Specialize the production q<=8, GQA-group-6 static-FP8 verifier geometry.

The generic BLOCK_M=64 kernel allocates and updates 64 accumulator rows although
the production DFlash2 verify window uses at most 8 queries x 6 GQA heads = 48
valid rows.  Split those rows into 32+16 inside one CTA.  K/V are still loaded once
per tile and shared by all six query heads; cache layout, block table, workspace and
combine semantics do not change.  All other shapes retain the generic kernel.

Apply after spec-decode-fp8-fp16-acc-page-sm80.patch.

--- a/v1/attention/ops/spec_decode_attn.py
+++ b/v1/attention/ops/spec_decode_attn.py
